# Plan orchestrator

All plan file content must be **English**.

## Mission

Orchestrate the correct **rules** and **skills** for the request, run **planning only**, and save one markdown plan under `Documents/`.

**Never implement.** Do not edit `src/`, theme files, configs, or tests. The only write in this run is the plan under `Documents/`.

---

## Step 1 — Classify the request

| Type | Signals |
|------|---------|
| `figma-delta` | Figma URL, node-id, sync from Figma, changed frames |
| `prd-feature` | PRD path, new feature, requirements doc |
| `bom-feature` | BOM, `docs/prd/bom-prd.md`, upload/mapping flow |
| `ui-screenshot` | Screenshot, mock, image — no Figma MCP |
| `ui-change` | Change existing screen/flow, no design file |
| `ds-parity` | Design system audit, token parity, Figma ↔ repo |

If ambiguous, ask one short question. Do not guess.

---

## Step 2 — Orchestrate for planning

Read and follow each selected `SKILL.md` or `.mdc` for **planning only** — ignore implement steps in those files during this run.

### Planning orchestration by type

| Type | Orchestrate for planning |
|------|--------------------------|
| `figma-delta` | `@figma-console-mcp` · `@prd-ux-implementation-planner` · `@hydra-design-to-code` |
| `prd-feature` | `@prd-ux-implementation-planner` · `@product-ux-rules` |
| `bom-feature` | `@prd-ux-implementation-planner` · `AGENTS.md` · `docs/prd/bom-prd.md` |
| `ui-screenshot` | `@hydra-design-to-code` · `@hydra-ui-tokens-and-components` |
| `ui-change` | `@prd-ux-implementation-planner` · `@hydra-ui-tokens-and-components` |
| `ds-parity` | `@ds-parity-auditor` · `@figma-console-mcp` · `@figma-repo-parity` |

Figma types: **Figma Console MCP only** (`user-figma-console`). Never official Figma MCP.

