## Step 3 — Implementation invocation map (embed in every plan)

For each request type, the plan **must** include the matching blocks below. Per-phase blocks may add or drop items if justified (document why).

### Baseline (attach for every UI implementation phase)

```
@scope-guardrails
@token-discipline
@ux-guardrails
@hydra-ui-tokens-and-components
```

Path for skill: `Documentation/hydra-ai-pack/skills/hydra-ui-tokens-and-components`

Implicit rules above are always on; still list them in the plan so implementers know what applies.

### By request type — default implementation attach set

| Type | Attach in implementation chat |
|------|--------------------------------|
| `figma-delta` | `@figma-console-mcp` `@hydra-design-to-code` `@hydra-ui-tokens-and-components` `@scope-guardrails` `@token-discipline` |
| `prd-feature` | `@hydra-ui-tokens-and-components` `@product-ux-rules` `@scope-guardrails` `@token-discipline` |
| `bom-feature` | `@hydra-ui-tokens-and-components` `@product-ux-rules` `@scope-guardrails` `@token-discipline` + `@docs/prd/bom-prd.md` `AGENTS.md` |
| `ui-screenshot` | `@hydra-design-to-code` `@hydra-ui-tokens-and-components` `@scope-guardrails` `@token-discipline` |
| `ui-change` | `@hydra-ui-tokens-and-components` `@scope-guardrails` `@token-discipline` `@product-ux-rules` |
| `ds-parity` | `@ds-parity-auditor` `@figma-console-mcp` `@figma-repo-parity` `@scope-guardrails` — **ask sync direction before edits** |

Add `@figma-repo-parity` to any implementation phase that changes theme, primitives, or `src/theme/*`.

---

## Step 4 — Planning work (read-only)

1. Scope — routes, pages, components, state.
2. Current flow audit.
3. Requirements / gap table.
4. UX review.
5. Phased plan (description only).
6. Guardrails.
7. Acceptance criteria.

`figma-delta` / `ds-parity`: `figma_get_status` (probe). If Bridge is down, record blocker; no official MCP.

`bom-feature`: requirements from `docs/prd/bom-prd.md`.

---

## Step 5 — Write plan file

### Path

| Case | Path |
|------|------|
| Default | `Documents/plans/<YYYY-MM-DD>-<short-slug>-plan.md` |
| BOM | `Documents/Bom/<YYYY-MM-DD>-<short-slug>-plan.md` |

Collision: append `-2`, `-3`. Create `Documents/plans/` if missing.

