## Step 6 — Chat reply (English)

1. Request type and rationale.
2. Full plan path under `Documents/`.
3. Default implementation `@` set for this type.
4. Blockers if any.
5. Tell user to approve a phase, then start a **new chat** using the **Phase N — copy-paste prompt** from the plan.

---

## Hard constraints

| Allowed | Forbidden |
|---------|-----------|
| Read repo, PRD, Figma (Console) | Edit `src/`, `public/`, theme, package files |
| Write plan under `Documents/` | Application code or config changes |
| Summarize + link PRD | Paste full PRD into plan |

